OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cold but
OL,6,Fdry night with extensive clear spells
OL,7,Fallowing a frost to form, particularly
OL,8,Fin rural locations. Coastal spots
OL,9,Fcould still see the odd shower through
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FFine, but cold on Friday with
OL,13,Fsunny spells and winds easing. Cloud
OL,14,Fbuilding overnight, however some
OL,15,Fpatchy frost is still possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
